From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:14:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 1689: a person's answers are filed under the trade the goal
 names, and the empty '' row leaves the admin page
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 48543 (never relayed until the founder's list, 52770): the per-person
record's „field" was the goal's first three words, transliterated — task_ask
18008 was filed as „arkitektoris mozebna kerzo" — so every goal made a field
of its own and a person's answers never added up; and an empty row showed.

- askField: a goal that names a trade, in any case and either language, is
  filed under the trade's own word (personByName's reading, now exported as
  tradeNamedIn; lawyer and advocate are one family); a goal that names none
  keeps its first field words. Asks already filed keep their old field.
- The admin page leaves off the '' row (kept for `bridged`) when it holds
  nothing.

Admin-only; no words a user reads.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
